      - 让<Gladiator>带伤奔跑[<color=#FF4040>+2受伤</color>]
      - Anna hänen auttaa [<color=#FF4040>+2 loukkaantumista</color>]
      - 让<Gladiator>带伤奔跑[<color=#FF4040>+2受伤</color>]
      - Позволить <Gladiator> вмешаться [<color=#FF4040>+2 ед. урона</color>]
      - '<Gladiator>に飛び込まさせる [<color=#FF4040>負傷が2増加</color>]'
      - Laissez <Gladiator> courir dedans [<color=#FF4040>+2 blessures</color>].
      - Lasse <Gladiator> einlaufen [<color=#FF4040>+2 Verletzung</color>]
